          <li>Phone: +91 6284910733</li>
          <li>Email: info@elearnkranti.com</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elearn-kranti-a1ab65395/">Linkedin</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/elearnkranti?igsh=aDZpcnpmNGxoZWF6&utm_source=qr">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61585129565822">Facebook</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
     
